window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Even surviving Cormaine couldn't prepare Zalia for the treachery, dangerous magic, and armies of hell that await her back in Endaria.</b></p> <p>Zalia has finally made her way back to Endaria after escaping the hellish nightmare of Cormaine. Yet instead of a warm welcome, she finds her friends scattered, their armies crumbling, and demons slaughtering their way across the kingdom.</p> <p>Newly ranked-up and hardened by her experiences—and with her feisty mountain ice cat, Boreal by her side—Zalia saves a young survivor, Aylie, as they look for any semblance of hope amid the chaos. Light begins to shine through as Zalia sets out to reunite with long-lost friends, gather allies, and reorganize the resistance.</p> <p>However, their struggle against the demon invasion will soon come to a head. Doubt plagues Zalia as she wonders whether the forces gathered will be enough to take back Endaria from its captors. Only time will tell if they can defeat the demonic god that has settled itself within the heart of the kingdom—and Zalia's new home.</p> <p><b>The third volume of this LitRPG adventure series—with more than two million views on Royal Road—now available in paperback, ebook, and audiobook!</b></p>"; 
